# The Go build reads the module files, the Go sources of the root package,
# the embedded OpenAPI document, and the `edl/` package. An allowlist keeps
# the Rust crates, the docs, and the deploy manifests out of this build
# context, so a change to them does not rebuild this image.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!*.go
!openapi.json
!edl/
# go build never reads a test file or testdata, so a test-only edit does not rebuild this image.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
